 [call [cmd ::math::decimal::fromstr] [arg string]]
 Convert [emph string] into a decimal.
+The string must be a number in decimal notation, with an optional sign,
+fractional part and exponent, or one of [const Inf] and [const NaN].
+Underscores are allowed between digits, as in Tcl 9.
